      "source_locator": "vitruvius-connection/001_Raw-Source-Layer/001-Laws/source-map-batch-138/lea-dsgn-004-05-core-concept.source-capture.md#sha256:71dfc1a37c8b8194474b60f6a46e69d9f5bf6791a341359d1e5ba8704bc896c7",
      "checked_markdown_lines": [
        "RA 10066 - National Cultural Heritage Act: The law protects, preserves, conserves, and promotes cultural heritage and institutions. Locator: RA 10066 refined markdown lines 37-48, 81-99, 198-219, 291-293, 443, 469-473, 502-503, and 541",
        "RA 10066 - National Cultural Heritage Act: Conservation work uses accepted standards and can involve cultural agencies and LGUs. Locator: RA 10066 refined markdown lines 37-48, 81-99, 198-219, 291-293, 443, 469-473, 502-503, and 541",
        "RA 10066 - National Cultural Heritage Act: Public access may be arranged subject to reasonable conservation and maintenance needs. Locator: RA 10066 refined markdown lines 37-48, 81-99, 198-219, 291-293, 443, 469-473, 502-503, and 541",
        "PD 1096 RIRR 2004 - DPWH Official: The Code regulates use, occupancy, location, site, design, maintenance, and conversion. Locator: PD 1096 RIRR refined markdown lines 75-85, 566-570, 762, 921-923, 1092-1149, 1174-1201, and 2916",
        "PD 1096 RIRR 2004 - DPWH Official: Floor plans must identify rooms or functional spaces. Locator: PD 1096 RIRR refined markdown lines 75-85, 566-570, 762, 921-923, 1092-1149, 1174-1201, and 2916",
        "PD 1096 RIRR 2004 - DPWH Official: Buildings are classified according to use or character of occupancy. Locator: PD 1096 RIRR refined markdown lines 75-85, 566-570, 762, 921-923, 1092-1149, 1174-1201, and 2916",
        "PD 1096 RIRR 2004 - DPWH Official: Change of use must conform with the Code and IRR. Locator: PD 1096 RIRR refined markdown lines 75-85, 566-570, 762, 921-923, 1092-1149, 1174-1201, and 2916",
        "RA 9514 Revised IRR 2019 - Fire Code: The Fire Code defines dormitories and classifies public museums/exhibition halls as assembly when gathering thresholds apply. Locator: RA 9514 RIRR refined markdown lines 1435, 2521-2524, 2591, 2667-2687, 4087, 4479-4495, 5321-5476, and 7466",
        "RA 9514 Revised IRR 2019 - Fire Code: Egress, exit lighting, emergency lighting, alarms, and sprinklers depend on occupancy and scale. Locator: RA 9514 RIRR refined markdown lines 1435, 2521-2524, 2591, 2667-2687, 4087, 4479-4495, 5321-5476, and 7466",
        "RA 9514 Revised IRR 2019 - Fire Code: Hotel and dormitory rooms need fire-resistance separation based on sprinkler protection. Locator: RA 9514 RIRR refined markdown lines 1435, 2521-2524, 2591, 2667-2687, 4087, 4479-4495, 5321-5476, and 7466"
      ],
